ou are the last one who can change its fate: heal it, hold it back from collapse\u2026 or drive it to ruin with your own hands!","steam_appid":3538250,"support_info":{"email":"almaz3344@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Russian","type":"game","website":null}